<title>JAPAN: Kyokuto Kaihatsu - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Kyokuto Kaihatsu - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 28.59		vs	   25.37</p>
<p> Operating	  808    million	  vs	    1.26</p>
<p> Current	    982    million	  vs	    1.43</p>
<p> Net		  609    million	  vs	  700    million</p>
<p> EPS		   20.01 yen	  vs	   23.00 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     30 million	  vs	  30 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  4.75 yen	  vs	    4.50 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Kyokuto Kaihatsu Kogyo Co Ltd is a leading maker of specility vehicles, such as dump trucks and tank lorries.</p>
